 al AI assistant on your own laptop and learn to message it from your phone
 \, with no coding required.\n\nOrganiser: Switzerland AI Community\n\nDeta
 ils and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/saic-build-your-ow
 n-ai-assistant-geneva-2026/
