SUMMARY:Atelier IA pour les fondations et associations philanthropiques
LOCATION:Société suisse des entrepreneurs (SSE)\, Rue de Malatrex 14\, Ge
 neva
DESCRIPTION:A practical French-language morning for Geneva foundations and 
 philanthropic associations: an introduction to the common AI tools\, then 
 guided exercises on admin work\, reviewing grant applications and reportin
 g impact\, with attention to confidentiality and checking what the model p
 roduces.\n\nOrganiser: Office cantonal de l'économie et de l'innovation (
 OCEI) with SwissFoundations and proFonds\n\nDetails and registration: http
 s://swissdataevents.ch/events/ocei-atelier-ia-fondations-geneva-2026/
